# Supermarket Business Analysis: Cleaned SQL Report

This report contains the SQL queries and outputs executed on the **cleaned dataset** (deduplicated and null-handled).

## 1. Payment Methods and Sales
```sql
SELECT 
            payment_method, 
            COUNT(invoice_id) AS transaction_count, 
            SUM(quantity) AS total_items_sold
        FROM sales
        GROUP BY payment_method;
```

### Output:
| payment_method   |   transaction_count |   total_items_sold |
|:-----------------|--------------------:|-------------------:|
| Cash             |                1832 |               4984 |
| Credit card      |                4256 |               9567 |
| Ewallet          |                3881 |               8932 |

